        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. The Boeing Stock fund portion of the VIP will be designated as an Employee Stock Ownership Plan. Employees who have all or a portion of their VIP account invested in the Boeing Stock Fund will be able to choose a one hundred percent (100%) cash payment of dividends. Alternatively, employees may continue automatic reinvestment of those dividends.",
