        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 15.6 Participant Elective Contributions Not Applicable for Other Purposes. It is acknowledged that the election of a Member to convert a portion of his or her base pay under the terms of the Plan will be effective for purposes of this Plan and will reduce the Member's compensation insofar as certain payroll taxes may be applicable. However, for all other employment-related purposes, including all of the Member's rights and privileges under this labor agreement, his or her base pay or compensation will be considered as though no election had been made.",
